  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, an envoy’s ability to charm and influence people becomes so strong that any attempts made against him and those around him are near impossible. An envoy is immune to charm effects. All allies within 20 feet gain a +4 morale bonus on saving throws against charm effects. This ability only functions while the envoy is conscious (not if he is unconscious or dead).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/envoy#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
